WEBVTT

00:10:27.811 --> 00:10:32.489
But today, I want to say loud and clear

00:10:32.513 --> 00:10:36.553
that I don't see disadvantages
from developing countries anymore.

00:10:36.893 --> 00:10:38.429
On the contrary,

00:10:38.453 --> 00:10:41.846
I see countries that have
the biggest opportunity

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.002
to do things in the right way,

00:10:44.026 --> 00:10:48.064
countries that can define
their own kind of development

00:10:48.088 --> 00:10:52.469
and have the most advantage
to build a better and safer environment

00:10:52.493 --> 00:10:53.905
for everyone.

00:10:53.929 --> 00:10:57.420
What worked for our ancestors
for thousands of years

00:10:57.444 --> 00:10:58.731
can work for us now,

00:10:58.755 --> 00:11:00.215
and in the future,